1
00:00:00,015 --> 00:00:01,115
(Mrs Hofstadter:)Sheldon.

2
00:00:01,984 --> 00:00:03,654
(Sheldon:)You tracked my phone?

3
00:00:03,819 --> 00:00:05,059
(Howard:)Yeah.

4
00:00:05,221 --> 00:00:08,901
(Sheldon:)Boy, you chase one balloon
for three miles.

5
00:00:11,393 --> 00:00:13,063
(Penny:)We were worried about you.

6
00:00:13,229 --> 00:00:15,339
(Sheldon:)Don't be melodramatic.

7
00:00:15,498 --> 00:00:18,408
(Sheldon:)I'm just getting on a train
and leaving forever.

8
00:00:19,969 --> 00:00:23,249
(Leonard:)Seriously? You don't even have
a change of clothes or a toothbrush.

9
00:00:23,405 --> 00:00:26,245
(Sheldon:)My plan is to stop
at malls and buy what I need.

10
00:00:26,408 --> 00:00:28,318
(Sheldon:)It's called living off the land.

11
00:00:29,245 --> 00:00:32,595
(Leonard:)Okay, I know you're upset
and there's a lot of stuff going on,

12
00:00:32,748 --> 00:00:35,748
(Leonard:)but it's nothing we can't work out.
Come on, let's get you home.

13
00:00:35,918 --> 00:00:39,768
(Sheldon:)No. I've reached my breaking point.
I need to leave. Now.

14
00:00:39,922 --> 00:00:42,532
(Penny:)-And go where?
-It doesn't matter.

15
00:00:42,691 --> 00:00:45,831
(Leonard:)So a few things don't go your way,

16
00:00:45,995 --> 00:00:49,775
(Leonard:)and your best decision
is to ride the rails like a hobo?

17
00:00:51,934 --> 00:00:53,604
(Sheldon:)I suppose it is.

18
00:00:53,769 --> 00:00:55,609
(Sheldon:)Except I have a credit card.

19
00:00:55,771 --> 00:01:01,021
(Sheldon:)And I refuse to carry
my laptop at the end of a stick.

